## Key files
- `data/catalog.json` — 980-sticker master list
- `data/inventory.db` — SQLite DB (auto-created)
- `docs/index.html` — GitHub Pages source (auto-generated, do not edit by hand)
- `images/inbox/` — drop new photos here
- `images/processed/` — moved here after update_inventory.py runs
- `images/faces/` — family member photos embedded in the report header
- `reports/` — HTML reports (local archive)

