## CLI reference (agent use only — user never runs these)
```bash
python3.11 scripts/build_catalog.py   # one-time setup
python3.11 scripts/scan.py            # list inbox contents
python3.11 scripts/update_inventory.py --help
python3.11 scripts/status.py          # terminal overview
python3.11 scripts/missing.py         # missing list (--team ARG or --group J)
python3.11 scripts/trade.py           # extras for trading
python3.11 scripts/report.py          # generate iPhone HTML report
python3.11 scripts/publish.py         # regenerate + commit + push to GitHub Pages
```
